  ('61000000-0000-0000-0000-000004010211', '51000000-0000-0000-0000-000000040102', 'hard', 1, 'Jack thinks of a number. He divides it by 6 and gets 7. What was his number?', 'short_answer', NULL, '"42"'::jsonb, '? ÷ 6 = 7. Undo it by multiplying: 7 × 6 = 42.', NULL, NULL, '90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001'),
